{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]老大的营地里经常有契约者朋友来访吧？我想找点擅长战斗的人来指点我一下，能过过招就更好了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]不过说实话，我只和自卫团的大家打过交道，实在是不清楚老大的朋友们擅长什么。只是直觉感觉到其中有几位很强，靠近他们的时候有时毛都会竖起来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]你说……要想打败他们，我可能还得多练练？那是自然的。我也不觉得我现在强到哪里去。但……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]回想到被巴诺姆村收留前，就是因为自己不够强壮，才会一直被人欺负的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]但，之后到了巴诺姆村也是这样。就是因为我们自己不够强，才会被魔物欺负，被那群不怀好意的人看上。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]之前我能从佣兵团逃脱，但这次巴诺姆的大家可无路可逃。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]所以我必须使劲练习。不是为了输赢，只是为了变强……！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1e"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]啊？老大说……我现在想要继续变强，已经不只是为了自己了？汪？这是啥意思？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"卡夫","text":"[show]不用在意，会尽快给我安排练习的对象？真的吗！真的是太感谢了！老大真是对我最好的人了！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"x":330,"mirrow":false,"y":14,"img":"chara023_1","addImg":"chara023_1_face_chara023_1d"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"卡夫-在东张西望什么？","script":"sj_023_03"}